        <mxCell id="note" value="&lt;b style='font-size:13px;'&gt;Cadena con pivote&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;span style='font-size:11px;'&gt;1. M6→M1: :80 wp2shell/PHP2Shell&lt;br&gt;2. M1→M2: wp-config + Redis&lt;br&gt;3. M2→M3: backups con claves&lt;br&gt;4. M1→M4: EB + privesc (pivote)&lt;br&gt;5. M4→M5: reúso (pivote)&lt;br&gt;6. Parchear + verificar&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f9fafb;strokeColor=#d1d5db;fontColor=#374151;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=12;spacingRight=12;fontSize=11;arcSize=3;" vertex="1" parent="1">
